  "_comment": [
    "Sources for the era/country action-card art on /actions.",
    "Keys are '<era>/<slug>' (era-generic) or '<era>/<country>/<slug>' (national).",
    "Every entry is public domain or a free CC/open licence — see `license` and `credit`.",
    "Fetch + optimise:  node scripts/fetch-action-images.mjs",
    "Publish to R2:     node scripts/upload-action-images-to-r2.mjs",
    "Adding a national image also requires listing its slug in ERA_COUNTRY_SLUGS",
    "in src/lib/images/actionImages.ts, or the resolver will keep serving the generic.",
    "Optional `gravity` (a sharp position: top/north/bottom/…) moves the 2:1 card crop",
    "off centre; use it when the subject sits high or low in the frame."
